{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maze Lovers Memorial</strong>: <i>Where your forever, is forever ingrained</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this cozy, physics-based puzzle game, you guide a marble through over 80 mazes, each one nestled within an atmospheric cemetery. Every maze you solve brings new life to the resting place it guards\u2014flowers bloom from tombstones, and with a touch of humor the memory of those who\u2019ve passed is ingrained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no rush, no danger\u2014only the simple joy of solving puzzles and watching beauty grow from stillness.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80 Physics-Based Mazes to Solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy Graphics and Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden Interactions all Around</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is in active development</i>, and will be adding more puzzles along the way!\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I appreciate your feedback, whether it is good or bad :)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792900?t=1749691063","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792900?t=1749691063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792900/4359010b68a7cfb3988bf08d955c235497f470f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749691063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792900/4359010b68a7cfb3988bf08d955c235497f470f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749691063","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes"